{"translation":{"id":"cmn_cu1","name":"新标点和合本","website":"https://ebible.org/Scriptures/details.php?id=cmn-cu89s","licenseUrl":"https://ebible.org/Scriptures/details.php?id=cmn-cu89s","licenseNotes":null,"shortName":"CU1","englishName":"Chinese Union Version (simplified)","language":"cmn","textDirection":"ltr","sha256":"1f0247773be3712e994ac4eccb3b624b101fa6fae60aa587349845096ad56a19","availableFormats":["json"],"listOfBooksApiLink":"/api/cmn_cu1/books.json","numberOfBooks":66,"totalNumberOfChapters":1189,"totalNumberOfVerses":31021,"languageName":"中文","languageEnglishName":"Chinese"},"book":{"id":"DEU","translationId":"cmn_cu1","name":"申命记","commonName":"申命记","title":"申命记","order":5,"numberOfChapters":34,"sha256":"35327388dd3d83dc5cbf3bb3b8e1fb1773933284ab37065518e57d824ed6b819","firstChapterNumber":1,"firstChapterApiLink":"/api/cmn_cu1/DEU/1.json","lastChapterNumber":34,"lastChapterApiLink":"/api/cmn_cu1/DEU/34.json","totalNumberOfVerses":951},"chapter":{"number":34,"content":[{"type":"heading","content":["摩西去世"]},{"type":"verse","number":1,"content":["摩西从摩押平原登尼波山，上了那与耶利哥相对的毗斯迦山顶。耶和华把基列全地直到但，"]},{"type":"verse","number":2,"content":["拿弗他利全地，以法莲、玛拿西的地，犹大全地直到西海，"]},{"type":"verse","number":3,"content":["南地和棕树城耶利哥的平原，直到琐珥，都指给他看。"]},{"type":"verse","number":4,"content":["耶和华对他说：「这就是我向亚伯拉罕、以撒、雅各起誓应许之地，说：『我必将这地赐给你的后裔。』现在我使你眼睛看见了，你却不得过到那里去。」"]},{"type":"verse","number":5,"content":["于是，耶和华的仆人摩西死在摩押地，正如耶和华所说的。"]},{"type":"verse","number":6,"content":["耶和华将他埋葬在摩押地、伯·毗珥对面的谷中，只是到今日没有人知道他的坟墓。"]},{"type":"verse","number":7,"content":["摩西死的时候年一百二十岁；眼目没有昏花，精神没有衰败。"]},{"type":"verse","number":8,"content":["以色列人在摩押平原为摩西哀哭了三十日，为摩西居丧哀哭的日子就满了。"]},{"type":"verse","number":9,"content":["嫩的儿子约书亚；因为摩西曾按手在他头上，就被智慧的灵充满，以色列人便听从他，照着耶和华吩咐摩西的行了。"]},{"type":"verse","number":10,"content":["以后以色列中再没有兴起先知像摩西的。他是耶和华面对面所认识的。"]},{"type":"verse","number":11,"content":["耶和华打发他在埃及地向法老和他的一切臣仆，并他的全地，行各样神迹奇事，"]},{"type":"verse","number":12,"content":["又在以色列众人眼前显大能的手，行一切大而可畏的事。"]}],"footnotes":[]},"thisChapterLink":"/api/cmn_cu1/DEU/34.json","thisChapterAudioLinks":{},"nextChapterApiLink":"/api/cmn_cu1/JOS/1.json","nextChapterAudioLinks":{},"previousChapterApiLink":"/api/cmn_cu1/DEU/33.json","previousChapterAudioLinks":{},"numberOfVerses":12}